data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Analyzing the Structure**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the image to understand its structure. It appears to be a table comparing Geraldton Wax Flower varieties. I've identified the header and some of the column labels, including one named 'Pearl Buttons' and another marked with an asterisk, which seems to indicate varieties used for comparison. The first column will contain row labels, too.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 2362,"totalTokenCount": 2459,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 178},{"modality": "IMAGE","tokenCount": 2184}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 97},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-argon","responseId": "GDbxauXKLfeQiLMP-bSM0Qg"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Transcribing the Table**\n\nI've completed the transcription of the Geraldton Wax Flower variety comparison table into Markdown format. The table includes stem thickness, mature leaf length, and mature leaf width, with mean, range, and standard deviation data for each variety: 'Pearl Buttons', 'White Spring', 'Pristine', 'Triumphant', and 'Mullering Brook'. I am now organizing the data.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 2362,"totalTokenCount": 3048,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 178},{"modality": "IMAGE","tokenCount": 2184}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 686},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-argon","responseId": "GDbxauXKLfeQiLMP-bSM0Qg"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Adding Pedicel Data**\n\nI'm now integrating pedicel length and floral tube colour data into the markdown table. This includes mean, range, and standard deviation for pedicel length, as well as descriptions and RHS color numbers for the floral tube across different sections of the flowers, and for old flowers. The formatting seems a bit tricky, but I think I have it nailed down.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 2362,"totalTokenCount": 3558,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 178},{"modality": "IMAGE","tokenCount": 2184}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 1196},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-argon","responseId": "GDbxauXKLfeQiLMP-bSM0Qg"}

